@startuml getProtocolFromProtocolEnum
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getProtocolFromProtocolEnum – Convert ONF Protocol Enum
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "function getProtocolFromProtocolEnum" as fn #LightCyan

note over requestor
  The requestor provides an ONF protocol enum value
  to retrieve a simplified protocol key and the original enum value.
end note

requestor -> fn: getProtocolFromProtocolEnum(protocol)
activate fn

note over fn
  <u>Steps</u>
  - Match input enum to supported protocol enums  
    - HTTP -> "http"  
    - HTTPS -> "https"  
    - NOT_YET_DEFINED -> "not-yet-defined"  
  - Return array: [protocolKey, protocolEnumValue]
end note

fn --> requestor: [protocolKey, protocolEnumValue]
deactivate fn

@enduml
